    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file that translates a single text string between languages using a concrete external provider, I need to select a specific translation service. I will use the Amazon Translate service, which is a neural machine translation service provided by AWS. This choice is based on the requirement to use a concrete external provider and make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789850304548,
          "start": 1789850300698
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bb64311a0015mFU3EolBScSiw",
